{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-routing","title":"导航与路由 2.0：GoRouter、声明式路由与深度链接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/navigation-routing","wordCount":667,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"导航与路由-2-0-gorouter-声明式路由与深度链接\">导航与路由 2.0：GoRouter、声明式路由与深度链接</h1><p>Flutter 的 Navigator 1.0（命令式 API）因其简单直接被早期开发者广泛使用，但在处理深度链接、Web URL、嵌套导航等场景时力不从心。Navigator 2.0（声明式 API）解决了这些问题，但原生 API 过于复杂。<strong>GoRouter</strong> 是官方推荐的 Navigator 2.0 封装方案，以声明式配置 + 类型安全实现完整的路由系统。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Navigator 1.0</strong></td>\n<td>命令式路由（push/pop），简单但不支持 URL 同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Navigator 2.0</strong></td>\n<td>声明式路由，将路由状态声明为应用状态的一部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GoRouter</strong></td>\n<td>官方推荐的 Navigator 2.0 封装，支持 URL 路由、嵌套、重定向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GoRoute</strong></td>\n<td>GoRouter 中的单个路由定义（path + builder）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ShellRoute</strong></td>\n<td>GoRouter 中的嵌套路由，保持底部导航栏等外壳 UI 不重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>深度链接（Deep Link）</strong></td>\n<td>通过 URL 直接打开应用内特定页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>类型安全路由</strong></td>\n<td>通过代码生成的路由类，避免字符串路径拼写错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>重定向（Redirect）</strong></td>\n<td>在路由跳转时根据条件（如登录状态）修改目标路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-navigator-2-0\">为什么需要 Navigator 2.0</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph Nav1[&quot;Navigator 1.0(命令式)&quot;]&#10;    A1[push Route] --&gt; B1[页面栈增加]&#10;    C1[pop] --&gt; D1[页面栈减少]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Nav2[&quot;Navigator 2.0(声明式)&quot;]&#10;    E1[路由状态变化] --&gt; F1[Router.navigate]&#10;    F1 --&gt; G1[RouteInformationParser\\n解析 URL]&#10;    G1 --&gt; H1[RouterDelegate\\n构建页面栈]&#10;    H1 --&gt; I1[Navigator\\n渲染页面]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph Nav1[\"Navigator 1.0(命令式)\"]\n    A1[push Route] --&gt; B1[页面栈增加]\n    C1[pop] --&gt; D1[页面栈减少]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Nav2[\"Navigator 2.0(声明式)\"]\n    E1[路由状态变化] --&gt; F1[Router.navigate]\n    F1 --&gt; G1[RouteInformationParser\\n解析 URL]\n    G1 --&gt; H1[RouterDelegate\\n构建页面栈]\n    H1 --&gt; I1[Navigator\\n渲染页面]\n  end</pre><p>Navigator 1.0 的核心问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无 URL 状态：Web 端无法刷新、无法分享链接</li>\n<li>深度链接处理复杂：需要手动解析 URI 并映射到路由</li>\n<li>嵌套导航管理困难：多个 Navigator 之间的协调代价高昂</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gorouter-基础配置\">GoRouter 基础配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// router/app_router.dart&#10;final appRouter = GoRouter(&#10;  initialLocation: &#39;/home&#39;,&#10;  debugLogDiagnostics: kDebugMode,&#10;&#10;  // 全局重定向（权限检查）&#10;  redirect: (context, state) {&#10;    final isLoggedIn = context.read(authProvider).isLoggedIn;&#10;    final isAuthRoute = state.matchedLocation.startsWith(&#39;/auth&#39;);&#10;&#10;    if (!isLoggedIn &amp;&amp; !isAuthRoute) return &#39;/auth/login&#39;;&#10;    if (isLoggedIn &amp;&amp; isAuthRoute) return &#39;/home&#39;;&#10;    return null; // null 表示不重定向&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  routes: [&#10;    GoRoute(&#10;      path: &#39;/auth/login&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;login&#39;,&#10;      builder: (context, state) =&gt; const LoginPage(),&#10;    ),&#10;&#10;    ShellRoute(&#10;      builder: (context, state, child) {&#10;        return ScaffoldWithNavBar(child: child);&#10;      },&#10;      routes: [&#10;        GoRoute(&#10;          path: &#39;/home&#39;,&#10;          name: &#39;home&#39;,&#10;          builder: (context, state) =&gt; const HomePage(),&#10;        ),&#10;        GoRoute(&#10;          path: &#39;/profile&#39;,&#10;          name: &#39;profile&#39;,&#10;          builder: (context, state) =&gt; const ProfilePage(),&#10;          routes: [&#10;            GoRoute(&#10;              path: &#39;edit&#39;,  // 完整路径：/profile/edit&#10;              name: &#39;profile-edit&#39;,&#10;              builder: (context, state) =&gt; const EditProfilePage(),&#10;            ),&#10;          ],&#10;        ),&#10;        GoRoute(&#10;          path: &#39;/products/:id&#39;,&#10;          name: &#39;product-detail&#39;,&#10;          builder: (context, state) {&#10;            final id = state.pathParameters[&#39;id&#39;]!;&#10;            final tab = state.uri.queryParameters[&#39;tab&#39;];&#10;            return ProductDetailPage(id: id, initialTab: tab);&#10;          },&#10;        ),&#10;      ],&#10;    ),&#10;  ],&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// router/app_router.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final appRouter = GoRouter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  initialLocation: '/home',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  debugLogDiagnostics: kDebugMode,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 全局重定向（权限检查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  redirect: (context, state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final isLoggedIn = context.read(authProvider).isLoggedIn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final isAuthRoute = state.matchedLocation.startsWith('/auth');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!isLoggedIn &#x26;&#x26; !isAuthRoute) return '/auth/login';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (isLoggedIn &#x26;&#x26; isAuthRoute) return '/home';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return null; // null 表示不重定向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  routes: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    GoRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      path: '/auth/login',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name: 'login',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      builder: (context, state) => const LoginPage(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ShellRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      builder: (context, state, child) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return ScaffoldWithNavBar(child: child);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      routes: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GoRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          path: '/home',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          name: 'home',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          builder: (context, state) => const HomePage(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GoRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          path: '/profile',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          name: 'profile',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          builder: (context, state) => const ProfilePage(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          routes: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            GoRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              path: 'edit',  // 完整路径：/profile/edit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              name: 'profile-edit',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              builder: (context, state) => const EditProfilePage(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GoRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          path: '/products/:id',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          name: 'product-detail',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          builder: (context, state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            final id = state.pathParameters['id']!;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            final tab = state.uri.queryParameters['tab'];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return ProductDetailPage(id: id, initialTab: tab);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注册到应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class MyApp extends StatelessWidget {&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context) {&#10;    return MaterialApp.router(&#10;      routerConfig: appRouter,&#10;      title: &#39;My App&#39;,&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyApp extends StatelessWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return MaterialApp.router(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      routerConfig: appRouter,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      title: 'My App',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"导航操作\">导航操作</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 基础跳转&#10;context.go(&#39;/home&#39;);                    // 替换当前路由（不可返回）&#10;context.push(&#39;/products/123&#39;);          // 压栈（可返回）&#10;context.pop();                          // 弹出&#10;context.goNamed(&#39;product-detail&#39;, pathParameters: {&#39;id&#39;: &#39;456&#39;});&#10;&#10;// 携带参数&#10;context.push(&#39;/products/123?tab=reviews&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 返回值&#10;final result = await context.push&lt;bool&gt;(&#39;/confirm-dialog&#39;);&#10;if (result == true) {&#10;  // 用户确认&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 基础跳转</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context.go('/home');                    // 替换当前路由（不可返回）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context.push('/products/123');          // 压栈（可返回）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context.pop();                          // 弹出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context.goNamed('product-detail', pathParameters: {'id': '456'});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 携带参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>context.push('/products/123?tab=reviews');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final result = await context.push&#x3C;bool>('/confirm-dialog');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (result == true) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 用户确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全路由-代码生成\">类型安全路由（代码生成）</h2><p>GoRouter 提供代码生成插件（<code>go_router_builder</code>），通过注解生成类型安全的路由类，消除字符串路径拼写错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// routes/home_route.dart&#10;part &#39;home_route.g.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;@TypedGoRoute&lt;HomeRoute&gt;(path: &#39;/home&#39;)&#10;class HomeRoute extends GoRouteData {&#10;  const HomeRoute();&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context, GoRouterState state) =&gt; const HomePage();&#10;}&#10;&#10;@TypedGoRoute&lt;ProductDetailRoute&gt;(&#10;  path: &#39;/products/:id&#39;,&#10;)&#10;class ProductDetailRoute extends GoRouteData {&#10;  const ProductDetailRoute({required this.id, this.tab});&#10;&#10;  final String id;&#10;  final String? tab;&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Widget build(BuildContext context, GoRouterState state) {&#10;    return ProductDetailPage(id: id, initialTab: tab);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// routes/home_route.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>part 'home_route.g.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@TypedGoRoute&#x3C;HomeRoute>(path: '/home')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class HomeRoute extends GoRouteData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const HomeRoute();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context, GoRouterState state) => const HomePage();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@TypedGoRoute&#x3C;ProductDetailRoute>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  path: '/products/:id',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductDetailRoute extends GoRouteData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ProductDetailRoute({required this.id, this.tab});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String? tab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Widget build(BuildContext context, GoRouterState state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ProductDetailPage(id: id, initialTab: tab);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用类型安全路由：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 编译时验证路径参数&#10;const ProductDetailRoute(id: &#39;123&#39;, tab: &#39;reviews&#39;).go(context);&#10;const HomeRoute().push(context);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译时验证路径参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ProductDetailRoute(id: '123', tab: 'reviews').go(context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const HomeRoute().push(context);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"shellroute-底部导航栏实现\">ShellRoute：底部导航栏实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"ShellRoute(&#10;  builder: (context, state, child) {&#10;    return Scaffold(&#10;      body: child,&#10;      bottomNavigationBar: NavigationBar(&#10;        selectedIndex: _calculateSelectedIndex(state),&#10;        onDestinationSelected: (index) {&#10;          switch (index) {&#10;            case 0: context.go(&#39;/home&#39;);&#10;            case 1: context.go(&#39;/search&#39;);&#10;            case 2: context.go(&#39;/profile&#39;);&#10;          }&#10;        },&#10;        destinations: const [&#10;          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.home), label: &#39;首页&#39;),&#10;          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.search), label: &#39;搜索&#39;),&#10;          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.person), label: &#39;我的&#39;),&#10;        ],&#10;      ),&#10;    );&#10;  },&#10;  routes: [...],&#10;)&#10;&#10;int _calculateSelectedIndex(GoRouterState state) {&#10;  final location = state.uri.toString();&#10;  if (location.startsWith(&#39;/home&#39;)) return 0;&#10;  if (location.startsWith(&#39;/search&#39;)) return 1;&#10;  if (location.startsWith(&#39;/profile&#39;)) return 2;&#10;  return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ShellRoute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  builder: (context, state, child) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      body: child,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      bottomNavigationBar: NavigationBar(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        selectedIndex: _calculateSelectedIndex(state),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onDestinationSelected: (index) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          switch (index) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 0: context.go('/home');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 1: context.go('/search');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 2: context.go('/profile');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        destinations: const [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.home), label: '首页'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.search), label: '搜索'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          NavigationDestination(icon: Icon(Icons.person), label: '我的'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  routes: [...],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>int _calculateSelectedIndex(GoRouterState state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final location = state.uri.toString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (location.startsWith('/home')) return 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (location.startsWith('/search')) return 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (location.startsWith('/profile')) return 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"深度链接配置\">深度链接配置</h2><h3 id=\"android-配置-androidmanifest-xml\">Android 配置（AndroidManifest.xml）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;intent-filter android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;data android:scheme=&quot;https&quot;&#10;        android:host=&quot;example.com&quot;&#10;        android:pathPrefix=&quot;/products&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/intent-filter&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:autoVerify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--